{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 12, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "充", "id": "充"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "聖人", "id": "聖人"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.349468678892896, "source": "欲", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.8794650496471605, "source": "欲", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 0.8678641379686807, "source": "欲", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.265759410767051, "source": "充", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.5726122302071057, "source": "充", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.477302050402781, "source": "入", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.7957557815213154, "source": "禮", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "禮", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.3902906734131513, "source": "至", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 1.0685348334308318, "source": "聞", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.5726122302071057, "source": "聞", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.8678641379686807, "source": "聞", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.0910076892828904, "source": "使", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.265759410767051, "source": "國", "target": "名"}, {"weight": 2.8602943026588865, "source": "國", "target": "去"}, {"weight": 1.5610113185286258, "source": "國", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.378